      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-07-30T05:15:15.277Z",
      "description": "A command injection flaw in PCP's linux_sockets PMDA allows malicious shell metacharacters via the network.persocket.filter metric.\nThis failed validation lets attackers execute arbitrary commands as the PMDA user when metrics refresh.",
